  "title": "Pork Chops with Fresh Mushrooms",
  "description": "Fresh mushrooms, onions, and lightly breaded pork chops are cooked in a light but flavorful sauce made with wine, brandy, Worcestershire sauce, and balsamic vinegar.",
  "authors": [
